{"blocks": [{"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobtD6W1e.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobO3VVyt.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "人生は、綺麗事だけで創られていません"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何度も躓き、転け、立ち上がるからこそ今の自分がいるんだと思います。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "“なりたい自分”になれなくても、どんな状況でも自己証明をし続ける"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そうする限り、自分の存在は消えません。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 四期生 山田桃実(やまだももみ)です☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "16th Single BACKS曲\n「自称バレエダンサー」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVを公開致しました~🩰"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobJq2dLW.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mob78EmSx.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobavAXnv.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "鶴さんの柄が可愛いくてたくさん見つめてたよ~\n重厚感もあって、なんだかタイムスリップした気分でした⏱"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobtkQPuW.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽曲に合わせてメイクもつよつよでした💄🪞"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mob6Rntvx.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobCuMgXF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "赤い衣装は、足袋履いてたんです！\n初めて足袋を履いて踊りました~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今作も全員で一生懸命制作しました！\nもっともっと観てくださると嬉しいです~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "多くの方に届きますように！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サクラミーツ 🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "現在TVerで配信中です！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回は新企画、クイズ誰の頭の中？ です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "新メンバーに加入させていただいてから初めての企画でした🌟\nメンバーの頭の中を覗けて楽しかったです🧠"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://tver.jp/episodes/ep57kv81ca"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん見てください！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://www.tv-asahi.co.jp/douga_mv/sakura_meets_kc_2026"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "↑サクラミーツフェスのアーカイブ配信もぜひ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後までブログを読んで下さりありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break